      Document-root identity — type required; name optional short form.
    </see>
    <see type="def:SubBlockDefinition" relation="Defines">
      Sub-Block identity — name from the element tag; type derived from parent.
    </see>
    <see type="def:EmbeddedBlockDefinition" relation="SeeAlso">
      Embedded virtual files — same tag-as-type authoring as the document root.
    </see>
